  "clamp onto her skin extended to far-out vertices (rho > 120 mm of her trunk axis were skipped when > 45 mm from her skin), limit 30 -> 150 mm: 0 vertices left outside (trunkfix2 left 40 posterior femoral cutaneous nerve vertices)"
